764 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The Board of Directors has established a mission for the Beaches Water\240Co\055operative\073 \042To provide water service that is dependable\054 economical\054 and meets or exceeds health standards for all\240Co\055operative\240members\042\056 To meet that mission\054 the\240\240Co\055operative\047s business was divided into four areas\072 Operation\054 Administration\054 Environmental\054 and Financial\072)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 765 0 R
     /Pg 754 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
