768 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The Beaches Water\240Co\055operative\240consists of five pumping stations with a total of eight wells\056 All five stations are normally in operation supplying water to almost 800 homes\240in the communities of Long Beach\054 Calvert Beach\054 Cherry Lane Farms\054 Kings Creek II\054 and Calvert Beach Estates II\240\056\240Controls cycle the pumping stations on and off as needed\056 The system has sufficient capacity to add a good number of new homes which allows us to shutdown pumping stations for repairs and maintenance\056\240)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 769 0 R
     /Pg 754 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

