774 0 obj
  << /ActualText (We have improved our bill processing\054 and with billing handled from our office during the day\054 most questions are resolved immediately\056 Issues with the water system can also be quickly evaluated\056 The Beaches Water\240Co\055operative\240Rules have been updated to allow the Business Manager to process past due accounts\056 Water service is interrupted if a past due account is not paid\056)
     /K [ 10 ]
     /P 775 0 R
     /Pg 754 0 R
     /S /Span
